TI  - Revolutionizing safety training: enhancing safety knowledge acquisition, retention, and user experience with adaptive VR-LLM integration
PY  - 2026
T2  - Virtual Reality
VL  - 30
IS  - 1
DO  - 10.1007/s10055-025-01261-7
