AB  - In this demonstration, we will conduct a real-time feedback system for immersive exergames that provides encouraging voice feedback to support reflection-in-action during gameplay. The system collects both summary and formative data while players are playing exergames. By using a large language model, the system analyzes players’ performance and personal movement style, and selects suitable boxing-style feedback based on comparisons with data from other players. Short voice encouragement is delivered in real time to guide players to adjust their behavior during the exergame. Through this approach, we aim to enhance players’ immersive experience and support continuous improvement in exergames. © 2026 Copyright held by the owner/author(s).
