SP  - 942
EP  - 949
PB  - Association for Computing Machinery
DO  - 10.1145/3820915.3821062
UR  - https://doi.org/10.1145/3820915.3821062
AB  - Generative AI narrative generation is currently confronted with two core technical challenges: in long-range narrative coherence maintenance, where models struggle to preserve logical consistency across extended story arcs; and in cross-modal semantic alignment, where visual, auditory, and textual information often fail to achieve spatiotemporal synchronization, leading to disjointed outputs. To address these issues, this study constructs a generative AI narrative generation paradigm driven by multimodal fusion algorithms, which takes text, images, and audio as input and generates integrated, coherent multimodal narrative content for literary creation, film and television scriptwriting, news reporting and other scenarios. We propose a dynamic attention-based multimodal fusion mechanism that employs Transformer self- and cross-attention to achieve deep semantic alignment between modalities, and optimizes the generation process via reinforcement learning PPO algorithm. To support this, we construct a multi-dimensional evaluation dataset comprising over 10,000 narrative samples spanning more than 10 themes and 5 styles across domains such as literary fiction, film scripts, and news reports, with a complete data collection, annotation and quality control mechanism. Experimental validation on a distributed computing platform with four NVIDIA A100 GPUs—using narrative coherence, multimodal alignment and generative diversity as quantitative metrics and comparing with monomodal, traditional multimodal fusion and state-of-the-art generative AI models—shows that the proposed paradigm improves narrative coherence by 23.6% compared with baseline models, achieving a cross-modal semantic matching accuracy of 89.7%. This study provides a novel technical paradigm and large-scale high-quality dataset for generative AI narrative generation, and bears important innovative significance and practical application value for intelligent content creation, virtual reality interaction and other related fields.
